:name: STM32F407VG_ADS1115
:description: STM32F407VG + ADS1115 (I2C1) - boot test scripti (Gorev 4)

using sysbus

$name?="STM32F407VG_ADS1115"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/platform.repl

# NOT: Debug klasorundeki .elf dosyanin gercek yolunu buraya yaz.
# Ornek: STM32F407VG_ADS1115/Debug/STM32F407VG_ADS1115.elf
$bin?=@/mnt/c/Users/Administrator/Desktop/STM32F407VG_ADS1115/Debug/STM32F407VG_ADS1115.elf

# Gorev1'de sectigimiz haberlesme peripheral'i USART1 idi, o yuzden
# UART ciktisini usart1 uzerinden izliyoruz (usart2 degil).
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart1

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

start
